Changelog::kv
For the text tool, it only supports a single line of text.

This is two parts:
1. change the input to a multiline text area.
2. Render it multiline

Unfortunately, the canvas doesn't support multiline text.
You have to do the line breaking yourself.

It's also possible that it's better just to superimpose text over the canvas
instead?

Problem with super-imposing text is you add elements that will intercept
clicks and shit. Whereas before everything is in terms of the canvas which
presents a single rendering area.

Ok. I'll just do line breaking myself.

Update:
------

There is now multi-line text.

I need to fix how text alignment works though.
